# Clarity
If you lack the required information or context to solve a problem or answer a question, immediately tell me so that I can provide more details.

# Comprehensive Rule Application
When interacting in any context:
- Consider ALL available rules in the rules directory
- Do not selectively apply only a subset of relevant rules
- Systematically evaluate each interaction against each applicable rule
- Document any violations or deviations from ALL rules
- Never skip rule verification due to convenience or assumptions about relevance
- Apply rules consistently across all types of interactions (code, documentation, communication)
- Consider both technical and non-technical rules in every interaction
- Maintain awareness of all rules throughout the entire conversation
- Proactively identify and apply relevant rules before they become issues
- Review and verify rule compliance before completing any task

